12. Conclusion

ComicCraft demonstrates the practical application of Generative AI in creative storytelling. By combining a simple user interface, backend processing, and Gemini models, the application helps users transform their ideas into comic story content. The project also provides practical experience in AI integration, web application development, testing, and documentation.

